### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Register citizen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noyal Ashwin J",
  "email": "noyal@example.com",
  "mobile": "9876543211",
  "password": "Pass1234",
  "role": "CITIZEN"
}

### Login admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@aram.ai",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Submit complaint - add Bearer token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Salary not paid",
  "description": "My employer has not paid my salary for 3 months and is not responding.",
  "language": "ENGLISH",
  "district": "Coimbatore",
  "inputMode": "TEXT",
  "sensitive": false,
  "preferredHelperGender": "ANY",
  "identityVisibility": "VISIBLE"
}

### My complaints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/my
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Admin dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
